  "system": {
    "description": "<p>You reshape an entire ecosystem from the root up. In a 10-mile radius, you permanently alter the natural world: choose six effects from the Ecosystem Override list; additionally, one species of plant or beast is permanently altered to bear the orthogenic mark (geometric symmetry, heightened intelligence equivalent to Int 6, and loyalty to you); all future druids who enter the region must succeed on a DC 22 Wisdom save or experience a crisis of faith about the nature of nature itself. This spell leaves a permanent signature visible to all Detect Magic, True Seeing, and Divine Sense within range. The Whispered One sees it too.</p>",
